  "description": "“We’re thirty-two. The age we said we’d start dating.”\n\nTop singer in South Korea and a friend of 17 years. The so-called too comfortable guy friend, Kim Do-kyung.\n\n“If we’re still single at thirty-two, let’s just date.”\n\n“Im Ji-yoo, are you really sure about that?”\n\nWho would’ve thought he’d still remember those words spoken as a joke 12 years ago?\n\n“Are you crazy? Me and you? Ugh, that’s ridiculous…”\n\n“Ten minutes. I’ll seduce you in ten.” Do-kyung picked up his phone and pressed the stopwatch.\n\nAs Ji-yoo flinched in surprise, he pulled her waist as if to say, don’t be nervous. Then, he devoured her lips.\n\nThe alarm rang, signaling that ten minutes had passed—and Do-kyung paused for a moment.\n\n“Girlfriend? Friend? Choose.”\n\nThe guy friend who had always felt like a brother…turned out to be an homme fatale.\n\nHis sexy, beast-like touch—she didn’t hate it.\n\nNo, in fact, she liked it.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12477610)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/the-thrilling-temptaion-of-a-boyfriend/list?title_no=8750), [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/romance-m/irresistible-friend/list?title_no=8965), [Indonesian](https://www.webtoons.com/id/romance/my-irresistible-guy-friend/list?title_no=9421), [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0004203)",
